                                "example_id": "861ef11f-7792-4099-b8ca-5d5aac0df57d",
                                "sense_id": "82c7bccf-12a6-305b-97c8-42f8aa6dd369",
                                "text": "Когда́ они́ проезжа́ли ми́мо церкве́й, он неизме́нно снима́л ша́пку и крести́лся широко́ и аккура́тно и при э́том чуть-чу́ть коси́л гла́зом на своего́ сосе́да — ви́дит тот и́ли нет?",
                                "translation": "Whenever they drove past a church he invariably raised his hat and crossed himself punctiliously with a broad sweep of his arm, and as he did it he gave an almost imperceptible side-glance to his companion—is he noticing or not?",
                                "english": "Whenever they drove past a church he invariably raised his hat and crossed himself punctiliously with a broad sweep of his arm, and as he did it he gave an almost imperceptible side-glance to his companion—is he noticing or not?"
                            }
